WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.556
Find Settings.

2
00:00:01.676 --> 00:00:04.532
Open Account and settings, then click Settings.

3
00:00:04.652 --> 00:00:07.461
Read the practice preferences before changing them.

4
00:00:08.499 --> 00:00:10.461
Toggle beginner explanations.

5
00:00:10.581 --> 00:00:14.900
Switch Beginner Mode off and on to control additional order explanations.

6
00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:18.434
This does not change the five-question quiz pass requirement.

7
00:00:19.499 --> 00:00:20.962
Switch the display theme.

8
00:00:21.082 --> 00:00:24.785
Use the theme control in the top bar to switch between light and dark.

9
00:00:24.905 --> 00:00:28.551
Account security controls remain separate from practice settings.

